OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning applications for axed
OL,4,Aleisure centre pulled
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning applications for a scrapped
OL,7,Fleisure centre project have been
OL,8,Fwithdrawn after the council said it
OL,9,Fcould not afford the scheme.
OL,11,FProposals for Squire Lane Leisure
OL,12,FCentre in Bradford had been under way
OL,13,Ffor more than a decade but last month
OL,14,Fthe council's new Reform UK-led
OL,15,Fexecutive announced they would not go
OL,16,Fahead.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
