OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning applications for axed
OL,4,Aleisure centre pulled
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme was estimated to cost about
OL,7,F#32.9m and the government had committed
OL,8,Fa #20m grant towards the development `
OL,9,Fa grant that is now likely to be
OL,10,Fpulled, as it cannot be used for
OL,11,Fanother scheme.
OL,13,FThe council has already spent more than
OL,14,F#5m preparing the site, near Bradford
OL,15,FRoyal Infirmary, drawing up plans and
OL,16,Fsubmitting and securing planning
OL,17,Fpermission.
